001.steps:
1. Factory Default;
 2. Network - DNS - Settings;
 3. Check the settings tab;
 4.  Navigate to System - Diagnostics - Tech Support Report, export TSR, check the "DNS Settings".
5. From CLI, input "show dns base".

002.steps:
1. Rules and Policies - DNS Policy, enable a DNS Policy : Action-Filter, Interface-X0, Profile-DefaultProfile;
2. PC connected to X0, set dns server as X0 IP, do dig www.baidu.com;
3. Do packet capture on DUT, export packets;
4. Check DNS query..
